  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3801.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-08-24",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3801.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to implement RSA 125-L, as amended relative to participating in a multi-state climate registry, while retaining recognition of efforts to reduce greenhouse gas emissions undertaken voluntarily by New Hampshire sources that already have been recorded in the state’s registry for early reductions of greenhouse gas emissions.\n\nSource. #7456, eff 2-24-01; ss by #9393, INTERIM, eff 2-24-09, EXPIRES: 8-24-09; ss by #9470, eff 5-16-09",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3800.html"
